ut type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"6\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; IT support is available on Tuesdays &ndash; no <strong>7</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"7\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> is necessary</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; free check of blood <strong>8</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"8\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> and cholesterol levels (over 60s only)</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Other information</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; the library shop sells wall-charts, cards and <strong>9</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"9\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; evenings and weekends: free <strong>10</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"10\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> is available</p></div></div>",
