    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.25em;margin-bottom:12px;\">The effects of environmental change on birds</div><p style=\"font-weight:700;\">Mercury (Hg)</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Highly toxic</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Released into the atmosphere from coal</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; In water it may be consumed by fish</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; It has also recently been found to affect birds which feed on <strong>31</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"31\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Research on effects of mercury on birds</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Claire Varian-Ramos is investigating:</p><p style=\"padding-left:40px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; the effects on birds&rsquo; <strong>32</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"32\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> or mental processes, e.g. memory</p><p style=\"padding-left:40px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; the effects on bird song (usually learned from a bird&rsquo;s <strong>33</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"33\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> )</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Findings:</p><p style=\"padding-left:40px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; songs learned by birds exposed to mercury are less <strong>34</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"34\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:40px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; this may have a negative effect on birds&rsquo; <strong>35</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"35\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Lab-based studies:</p><p style=\"padding-left:40px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; allow more <strong>36</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"36\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> for the experimenter</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Implications for humans</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Migrating birds such as <strong>37</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"37\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> containing mercury may be eaten by humans</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Mercury also causes problems in learning <strong>38</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"38\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Mercury in a mother&rsquo;s body from <strong>39</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"39\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> may affect the unborn child</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; New regulations for mercury emissions will affect everyone&rsquo;s energy <strong>40</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"40\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p></div></div>",
